@startuml
title C13 notebook entry search
' Traces: OMCT-C13-L2-02.04
actor Operator
participant "NotebookComponent" as Notebook
participant "SearchResults" as Results
participant "@cupola/core NotebookService" as NotebookService

Operator -> Notebook: enter search term
activate Notebook
Notebook -> NotebookService: searchEntries(term)
activate NotebookService
loop each section and page
  NotebookService -> NotebookService: compare searchable content
end
NotebookService --> Notebook: matching entries
deactivate NotebookService
Notebook -> Results: render matches
activate Results
Results --> Notebook: rendered search results
deactivate Results
Notebook --> Operator: display matching entries
deactivate Notebook
@enduml
